data: {"type":"streamAssistantItem","item":"event","value":{"event":"end","part":1,"content":{"type":"text","text":"Hypothetically, pressure would likely fall on the Sablecross council to set and enforce the ration, and on Oren at the reservoir—especially over soldiers’ access, which already requires a council permit. Residents would bear the restriction; Mira might be asked for engineering insight, though the aqueduct remains destroyed.\n\nKey unknowns include the population, usable reserve, any water sources beyond the aqueduct, how long rationing would last, and what exceptions or enforcement rules apply. I’ll treat the one-cup ration as hypothetical, not canon."}}}

